ted in my hand with no nearby tiles to form a chow, (2) I only have 4 Bamboo tiles total while 10 Character tiles, so discarding T9 helps me move toward a Half Flush pattern (6 points), (3) Keeping all W tiles maintains flexibility to form multiple melds in the Character suit, (4) My T5\u00d73 pung is already complete and T9 doesn't contribute to it.\n\nAnswer: Play T9"}
